OL,3,APope pictured for first time since
OL,4,Asurgery and cancer diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo "celebrated with the medical
OL,7,Fand nursing staff" and thanked workers
OL,8,Ffor their service, the Vatican press
OL,9,Foffice said.
